          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 8:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa aamukobosia ali, “Se khukhoyeele khukhola khurio tawe, sikila khucha khuaana chimbosio khu Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, Wele wefwe nicho Bamisiri bakhenyanga tawe. Khwaaba ne khuaana chimbosio chisinyisia Bamisiri, se bacha khu khupa efwe kamabaale bakhwiire?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.8.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.8.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 8:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.8.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.8.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 8:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Khukhoyeele khuche lukeendo lwe chindaalo chitaru mu sichiimi mala khuaane chimbosio khu Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, Wele wefwe khuloondekhana nga ne acha khu khulaka efwe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.8.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.8.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 8:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Farao aaloma ali, “Ndamulekhuula muche muaane chimbosio khu Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, Wele wenywe mu sichiimi. Ne kakhali mukhacha aleeyi tawe. Khe musabile ese seesi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.8.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.8.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 8:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio Musa aaloma ali, “Nga ne nja khu khururao ndi, ndasaba Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi nio chiisi chikhururekho, ne khu bakholi bowo, ne khukhwama mu baandu bowo, muchuli. Ne kakhali lundi okhakhola bubeeyi khulwe khulekha khufukiilila babaandu bache khuaana chimbosio khu Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi tawe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.8.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.8.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 8:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio Musa alekha Farao mala acha aasaba Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.8.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.8.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 8:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi aakhola nga Musa aasaba, mala aarusia chiisi khu Farao, khu bakholi bewe, ne khukhwama mu baandu bewe. Mbao akhaba ndala eya sikala tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.8.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.8.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 8:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne kakhali Farao alumia kumwoyo kwewe akhaba mu siise sino siosi. Se aafukiilila babaandu bacha tawe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.8.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.8.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
